<title>USA: Nissan March US car sales fall.</title>
<headline>Nissan March US car sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nissan Motor Co Ltd</p>
<p>			Mar 1-31, 1997     Mar 1-31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    29,873	    32,060	     -6.8</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  26,392	    15,976	    +65.2</p>
<p> Import Car		26,138	    21,786	    +20.0</p>
<p> Import Truck	     7,953	     6,231	    +27.6</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Mar 31, 1997 Jan 1-Mar 31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    78,659	    81,579	     -2.3</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  49,790	    40,081	    +25.9</p>
<p> Import Car		57,835	    48,987	    +19.6</p>
<p> Import Truck	    22,938	    12,720	    +82.7</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 26 in latest month vs 26, 76 for year to date vs 77 in year ago.</p>
</text>
